# Hardware: open/close Macro quick properties without editing musical content.
# Tight counterpart of macro/editor-clipping-retained.ux, using the shared RAM fixture.
0 scenario bench-macro-v1
20 assert_view MACRO
100 transport start
180 button LEFT_BOTTOM down
260 tap MACRO_1 60
1300 button LEFT_BOTTOM up
1450 assert_mode macro.edit
1500 marker quick_before
1800 button LEFT_CENTER down
2000 marker quick_open
2200 button LEFT_CENTER up
2450 marker quick_closed
2500 assert_mode macro.edit
2800 button LEFT_CENTER down
3000 marker quick_reopen
3200 button LEFT_CENTER up
3450 assert_mode macro.edit
3700 tap LEFT_TOP 60
3900 assert_mode macro.performance
4100 transport stop
